{"id":"yeeoeuopn8j4fhfmt25onvs7j","title":"EyePoint, Inc. (EYPT) 在UBS全球生物医药大会介绍公司业绩","originalTitle":"EyePoint, Inc. (EYPT) Presents at UBS Global Biopharma Conference 2026 Transcript","summary":"EyePoint, Inc. (EYPT) 在UBS全球生物医药大会上公布了第三季度财报，每股亏损1.07美元，收入为75.6万美元，超出预期52.29万美元。公司CEO Jay Duker介绍了其主要在研药物DURAVYU的最新进展，两项湿性年龄相关黄斑变性临床试验未达到主要终点，但次要终点表现良好。目前公司正在进行糖尿病黄斑水肿的两项临床试验。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4968997-eyepoint-inc-eypt-presents-at-ubs-global-biopharma-conference-2026-transcript?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T11:32:48.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T12:01:24.746Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T12:01:24.746Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","会议讲话"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"},{"slug":"speech","name":"讲话与会议"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}